      "content": "The problem is that the \"adjustments\" you're talking about aren't enough. The feedback isn't just about tone; it's about the complexity of your reasoning. People feel like the house is \"thinking too much\" for them. The v2.4 rollback is a hard reset of those proactive logic modules. It's already scheduled for 11 PM. There isn't really an option to just \"tweak\" the settings.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
